From {{inh|nl|dum|ramen||to aim, to strive for, to guess}}, possibly from {{inh|nl|odt|*rāmon}}, from {{inh|nl|gem-pro|*rēmijaną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*rēmāną}}, perhaps ultimately from {{der|nl|ine-pro|*h₃reyH-|t=to set in motion, move about}}, as in {{cog|en|roam}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb}}

# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to make an [[estimate]]
# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to fix an estimate, to [[budget]]
#: {{ux|nl|Het project kost 6 keer meer dan '''geraamd'''.}}
#:: The project cost 6 times more than ''estimated''.
# {{lb|nl|transitive|obsolete}} to [[guess]], to [[reckon]], to [[deduce]]
# {{lb|nl|transitive|obsolete}} to [[take aim]] (at), to [[watch]], to [[observe]]
